          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जनमत (janmat) joins two Sanskrit words, jana, \"people\", and mata, \"an opinion\" (Monier-Williams): what the people think. The compound is a modern one."
