          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लोकतंत्र (loktantra) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit lokatantra, \"the system of the world\" (Monier-Williams). Modern Hindi gives the compound of loka, \"people\", and tantra, \"system\", a new sense: rule by the people."
            }
          ]
